 "remarks": "Welcome to 28 Courtland Avenue, Unit 1, a thoughtfully maintained 1-bedroom, 1-bath co-op offering a spacious layout, abundant natural light, and move-in-ready living in Stamford.    As an end unit, the home benefits from additional natural light that creates a bright and welcoming atmosphere throughout. Beautiful hardwood floors complement the generously sized living spaces, while the well-maintained interior makes this a home you can comfortably settle into from day one.    The property includes one assigned parking space and convenient laundry facilities in the basement. Owners also have the option to upgrade to in-unit laundry for an additional annual fee, providing added flexibility. One of the standout benefits of this co-op is what is included in the $620/month HOA fee: PROPERTY TAXES, heat, hot water, water, sewer, and property management - consolidating several significant housing expenses into one monthly payment.   Offered at $196,500, this move-in-ready home presents an attractive opportunity to enjoy homeownership in Stamford with a spacious floor plan, included utilities, assigned parking, and predictable monthly expenses.    Please note: This is a CO-OP property and all purchases are subject to co-op requirements and approval.  **Furniture indoor the unit for sale upon request.",
